      "reason": "The requested bias, RMSE, correlation, and model ranking on the WOA23 1° grid require one common mask over WOA23 and all three model fields on that comparison grid so scores are computed on the same cells for every model.",
      "status": "condensed",
      "notes": [
        "Regrid each model `tos` climatology to the WOA23 1° grid, then build **one shared mask over all three models and WOA23** with `build_comparison_mask`; apply `.where(mask)` to every field before bias, RMSE, correlation, and the Figure 1 maps, so all models are scored and ranked on the same cells.",
        "Because WOA23 is part of the comparison, keep `ocean_only=True` (the default); report the mask cell counts with the metrics, and report `mean_data` and `mean_reference` from `compute_difference_metrics` on that shared sample rather than means on different cells."
      ]
